# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "The tilted-field Ising model and its time evolution {#the-tilted-field-ising-model-and-its-time-evolution}"
msgstr "Le modèle d'Ising à champ incliné et son évolution temporelle {#the-tilted-field-ising-model-and-its-time-evolution}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Hamiltonian for the tilted-field Ising model is as follows:\n"
"$$\n"
"H = {g_x}\\sum_{k\\in{N}}{X_k} + {g_z}\\sum_{k\\in{N}}{Z_k} + J\\sum_{\\begin{matrix} {(k,l)}{\\in}{E} \\\\ {k<l} \\end{matrix}}{{Z_k}{Z_l}}\n"
"$$\n"
"where $J$ is the coupling strength, and $g_x$ and $g_z$ are the transverse and longitudinal field strengths, respectively. $X_k$ and $Z_k$ are the Pauli-X and Pauli-Z operators acting on the qubit with index $k$. $N$ is the set of indices of the qubits that evolve under the Hamiltonian. $E$ is the set of edges, each of which is a tuple of qubit indices $(k,l)$ between which two-qubit interactions are allowed. The condition $k<l$ ensures that no two-qubit interaction is repeated. The Trotterized evolution of the Hamiltonian for time $t$ with $r$ Trotter steps, each of time $\\Delta{t}$ (that is, $t=r\\Delta{t}$), is as follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"L'hamiltonien du modèle d'Ising à champ incliné est le suivant :\n"
"$$\n"
"H = {g_x}\\sum_{k\\in{N}}{X_k} + {g_z}\\sum_{k\\in{N}}{Z_k} + J\\sum_{\\begin{matrix} {(k,l)}{\\in}{E} \\\\ {k<l} \\end{matrix}}{{Z_k}{Z_l}}\n"
"$$\n"
"où $J$ est la force de couplage, et $g_x$ et $g_z$ sont les forces de champ transverse et longitudinal, respectivement. $X_k$ et $Z_k$ sont les opérateurs de Pauli-X et de Pauli-Z agissant sur le qubit d'indice $k$. $N$ est l'ensemble des indices des qubits qui évoluent sous l'hamiltonien. $E$ est l'ensemble des arêtes, dont chacune est un tuple d'indices de qubits $(k,l)$ entre lesquels des interactions à deux qubits sont permises. La condition $k<l$ garantit qu'aucune interaction à deux qubits n'est répétée. L'évolution de l'hamiltonien avec décomposition de Trotter pendant un temps $t$ avec $r$ pas de Trotter, chacun de durée $\\Delta{t}$ (c'est-à-dire $t=r\\Delta{t}$), est la suivante :\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{align}\n"
"e^{iHt}\n"
"&{\\quad}={\\quad}\n"
"e^{{i}\\bigg({g_x}\\sum_{k\\in{N}}{X_k} + {g_z}\\sum_{k\\in{N}}{Z_k} + J\\sum_{\\begin{matrix} {(k,l)}{\\in}{E} \\\\ {k<l} \\end{matrix}}{{Z_k}{Z_l}}\\bigg){t}}\n"
"\\\\\\\\ &{\\quad}\\approx{\\quad}\n"
"\\Bigg[\n"
"\\Bigg(e^{{i}\\big({g_x}\\sum_{k\\in{N}}{X_k}\\big){\\Delta{t}}}\\Bigg)\n"
"\\Bigg(e^{{i}\\big({g_z}\\sum_{k\\in{N}}{Z_k}\\big){\\Delta{t}}}\\Bigg)\n"
"\\Bigg(e^{{i}\\bigg(J\\sum_{\\begin{matrix} {(k,l)}{\\in}{E} \\\\ {k<l} \\end{matrix}}{{Z_k}{Z_l}}\\bigg){\\Delta{t}}}\\Bigg)\n"
"\\Bigg]^r\n"
"\\\\\\\\ &{\\quad}={\\quad}\n"
"\\Bigg[\n"
"\\bigg(\\prod_{k\\in{N}}{e^{{i}g_x{X_k}{\\Delta{t}}}}\\bigg)\n"
"\\bigg(\\prod_{k\\in{N}}{e^{{i}g_z{Z_k}{\\Delta{t}}}}\\bigg)\n"
"\\bigg(\\prod_{\\begin{matrix} {(k,l)}{\\in}{E} \\\\ {k<l} \\end{matrix}}{e^{{i}J{Z_k}{Z_l}{\\Delta{t}}}}\\bigg)\n"
"\\Bigg]^r\n"
"\\end{align}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{align}\n"
"e^{iHt}\n"
"&{\\quad}={\\quad}\n"
"e^{{i}\\bigg({g_x}\\sum_{k\\in{N}}{X_k} + {g_z}\\sum_{k\\in{N}}{Z_k} + J\\sum_{\\begin{matrix} {(k,l)}{\\in}{E} \\\\ {k<l} \\end{matrix}}{{Z_k}{Z_l}}\\bigg){t}}\n"
"\\\\\\\\ &{\\quad}\\approx{\\quad}\n"
"\\Bigg[\n"
"\\Bigg(e^{{i}\\big({g_x}\\sum_{k\\in{N}}{X_k}\\big){\\Delta{t}}}\\Bigg)\n"
"\\Bigg(e^{{i}\\big({g_z}\\sum_{k\\in{N}}{Z_k}\\big){\\Delta{t}}}\\Bigg)\n"
"\\Bigg(e^{{i}\\bigg(J\\sum_{\\begin{matrix} {(k,l)}{\\in}{E} \\\\ {k<l} \\end{matrix}}{{Z_k}{Z_l}}\\bigg){\\Delta{t}}}\\Bigg)\n"
"\\Bigg]^r\n"
"\\\\\\\\ &{\\quad}={\\quad}\n"
"\\Bigg[\n"
"\\bigg(\\prod_{k\\in{N}}{e^{{i}g_x{X_k}{\\Delta{t}}}}\\bigg)\n"
"\\bigg(\\prod_{k\\in{N}}{e^{{i}g_z{Z_k}{\\Delta{t}}}}\\bigg)\n"
"\\bigg(\\prod_{\\begin{matrix} {(k,l)}{\\in}{E} \\\\ {k<l} \\end{matrix}}{e^{{i}J{Z_k}{Z_l}{\\Delta{t}}}}\\bigg)\n"
"\\Bigg]^r\n"
"\\end{align}\n"
"$$\n"

